Create:

pre_decision_event_hub_payload.py

inside the HITL Pipeline Bridge.

ALL Pre-Decision Event Hub filtering/mapping logic currently located in CombinedExtractionOutput must be moved into this file.

This file should have no Azure Function trigger logic.

It should only be responsible for transforming the retrieved DU payload into the required Pre-Decision Event Hub payload.

For example:

def build_pre_decision_event_hub_payload(source_payload, ...):
    ...
